---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/data/site';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Financial Disclaimer"
  heading="Disclaimer"
  description="Fountain Finances provides educational information and comparisons only. It does not provide individualized financial, investment, tax, legal or credit advice."
  lede="Fountain Finances is a source of education and comparisons — not personal advice."
>
  <h2>Educational information only</h2>
  <p>All content on <strong>{SITE.domain}</strong> — including guides, comparisons, calculators, newsletters and answers to reader questions — is provided for general educational and informational purposes. It is <strong>not</strong> individualized financial, investment, tax, legal, insurance or credit advice, and it does not take into account your specific objectives, financial situation or needs.</p>

  <h2>We are not a financial institution</h2>
  <p>Fountain Finances is not a bank, credit union, lender, loan broker, credit card issuer, insurance company or agency, credit repair organization, debt settlement company, broker-dealer or registered investment adviser. We do not accept deposits, make loans, make credit decisions, sell insurance or manage investments.</p>

  <h2>No guarantees</h2>
  <p>We do not guarantee approval for any product, any interest rate or terms, any change in your credit score, or any financial outcome. Descriptions of how products typically work may not match a particular offer. Past performance of any investment does not guarantee future results, and all investing involves risk, including possible loss of principal.</p>

  <h2>Verify before you act</h2>
  <p>Rates, fees, rewards, eligibility requirements and laws change often. Before applying for or purchasing any financial product, read the provider’s official terms and disclosures and confirm the details directly with the provider. Where we display a specific rate or fee, we show the date our editors verified it; it may have changed since.</p>

  <h2>Calculators</h2>
  <p>Calculator results are estimates based on your inputs and simplified assumptions. They are not offers of credit, pre-qualifications or rate quotes.</p>

  <h2>Seek professional advice</h2>
  <p>For decisions that depend on your full circumstances — such as tax planning, investment allocation, bankruptcy, estate planning or complex debt situations — consider consulting a qualified professional such as a certified financial planner, CPA, attorney or nonprofit credit counselor.</p>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>References to third-party companies, products or services are not endorsements unless stated. We are not responsible for third-party content, products or decisions. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> and <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
